From: Taiyou06 <kaandindar21@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Apr 2025 18:07:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Leaf: Optimize dig speed effect lookups

Read the Haste and Conduit Power effects once each in their original order and keep the existing amplifier calculation.

Original patch: https://github.com/Winds-Studio/Leaf/blob/06c9c91a17e61aeed16bcfc846ebe91aa70d6c84/leaf-server/minecraft-patches/features/0188-Optimise-MobEffectUtil-getDigSpeedAmplification.patch

Ported from Lophine (GPLv3 for its changes; see licenses/GPL.md):
https://github.com/LophineLabs/Lophine/blob/7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02/lophine-server/minecraft-patches/features/0142-Leaf-Optimize-dig-speed-effect-lookups.patch
Lophine patch blob: aa0ebfd12553007c966b3321a701cff121ad2b8f
https://github.com/LophineLabs/Lophine/blob/7a51f49a512f1b5465f15a905d3704754e4bed02/LICENSE.md

Series copyright and original license notices: licenses/Lophine-0137-0158-NOTICE.txt

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectUtil.java b/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectUtil.java
index f1c57bc4310784999784d77678ea88912d6e41db..581aea02f6ed53d072caf47ddc051b497798fa33 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectUtil.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/effect/MobEffectUtil.java
@@ -27,17 +27,21 @@ public final class MobEffectUtil {
     }
 
     public static int getDigSpeedAmplification(final LivingEntity mob) {
-        int a = 0;
-        int b = 0;
-        if (mob.hasEffect(MobEffects.HASTE)) {
-            a = mob.getEffect(MobEffects.HASTE).getAmplifier();
+        // Leaf start - Optimise MobEffectUtil#getDigSpeedAmplification
+        int digAmplifier = 0;
+        int conduitAmplifier = 0;
+        MobEffectInstance digEffect = mob.getEffect(MobEffects.HASTE);
+        if (digEffect != null) {
+            digAmplifier = digEffect.getAmplifier();
         }
 
-        if (mob.hasEffect(MobEffects.CONDUIT_POWER)) {
-            b = mob.getEffect(MobEffects.CONDUIT_POWER).getAmplifier();
+        MobEffectInstance conduitEffect = mob.getEffect(MobEffects.CONDUIT_POWER);
+        if (conduitEffect != null) {
+            conduitAmplifier = conduitEffect.getAmplifier();
         }
 
-        return Math.max(a, b);
+        return Math.max(digAmplifier, conduitAmplifier);
+        // Leaf end - Optimise MobEffectUtil#getDigSpeedAmplification
     }
 
     public static boolean hasWaterBreathing(final LivingEntity mob) {
